{
  "key": 40211,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "DWRavagedPath_Text_CyrusFrightened",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: It's frightened. The whole\n",
        "space is. Can you feel it shake?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWRavagedPath_Text_CyrusFollowTheSeam",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Follow the seam.\r",
        "...Not that one.\n",
        "That one is a scar."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWRavagedPath_Text_CyrusScarHoldsYouOnce",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: A scar holds you once.\n",
        "Then it remembers it was a wound."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWRavagedPath_Text_CyrusAgainSlower",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Again. Slower. It doesn't\n",
        "punish you for trying."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWRavagedPath_Text_CyrusThereTheShard",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: There. The shard is in its\n",
        "chest. It's been fighting that\r",
        "thing for days."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWRavagedPath_Text_CyrusItsCalm",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...It's calm."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWRavagedPath_Text_GotCalmShard",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got a Calm Shard!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWRavagedPath_Text_CyrusITook",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: I took. You were given."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWRavagedPath_Text_CyrusComeTheRift",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Come. The rift will close\n",
        "behind us."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWRavagedPath_Text_CyrusSigil",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: The rune wakes the stone.\n",
        "Step on it. The bridge holds."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWRavagedPath_Text_CyrusHintAfterTwoFalls",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Press the rune first.\n",
        "The scar holds you once.\n",
        "Then it will not let you back."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
